  "zh": "# AI 能力共识差距扩大，OpenAI 公开数学手稿及 GPU 新品引关注\n## AI 与科技\n- **AI 能力共识差距扩大**：专家警告大模型能力理解不一致可能导致误用与监管挑战。\n- **AI 反编译游戏技术**：研究利用 500B tokens 实现第一人称射击游戏代码还原，展示生成 AI 新能力。\n- **开源语音转文字工具**：BetterWispr 提供免费离线麦克风 dictation，适合 Mac 用户隐私需求。\n## 行业动向\n- **OpenAI 公开 722 篇数学手稿**：丘成桐等数学家称此举推动学术透明并可能加速 AI 理论进展。\n- **RTX 5080 24GB 显卡传闻**：预计明年发布，或提升 AI 训练与游戏渲染算力。\n- **谷歌因建数据中心非法砍树**：芬兰环评被叫停，引发数据中心绿色争议与监管关注。\n## 社会民生\n- **纽约退订一键规则**：新规生效，在线订阅须一键完成退订，提升消费者权益。\n- **Passkeys 安全风险**：安全专家警告其可能带来新型钓鱼风险，需谨慎使用。",
  "en": "# AI capability consensus gap widens as OpenAI releases math manuscripts and new GPU rumors surface\n## AI & Tech\n- **AI capability consensus gap widening**：Experts warn inconsistent understanding of LLM abilities could lead to misuse and regulatory challenges.\n- **AI game decompilation technology**：Research shows 500B tokens can reconstruct code of a first‑person shooter, highlighting new generative AI capabilities.\n- **Open source speech to text tool**：BetterWispr offers free offline dictation for Mac, addressing privacy‑focused voice input needs.\n## Industry Trends\n- **OpenAI releases 722 math manuscripts**：Mathematicians including Yau say the move boosts academic transparency and may accelerate AI theory progress.\n- **RTX 5080 24GB GPU rumored**：Expected next‑year launch, promising higher AI training and graphics rendering power.\n- **Google illegal logging for data centers**：Finnish environmental assessment halted, sparking debate over data‑center sustainability and oversight.\n## Society\n- **New York one-click cancellation rule**：Rule now in effect, requiring online subscriptions to allow one‑click unsubscribe, strengthening consumer rights.\n- **Passkeys security risks**：Security experts caution that passkeys may introduce new phishing vectors and should be used carefully."
